ect\": true, \"speedup\": 1.1842}}, \"geomean_speedup\": 1.0809, \"all_correct\": true, \"decision\": \"accept\", \"decision_reason\": \"All 5 workloads correct; baseline geomean 1.0809x. WL3 (M=8192, B=32,S=256) at 0.8887x is the weak point: conservative 64x64x32 tile underperforms cuBLAS at large M, confirming prediction P1 (GEMM tuning highest leverage). Set as current best-correct.\", \"cumulative_evals\": 1, \"skill_usage\": \"none (KernelWiki N/A for sm_80; profiler disallowed)\"}\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
