{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-e110d40d-40b6-439d-9f90-e9cbda13a82c","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"Claude-Opus-4.8","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013uYn7HCA8YyjFC5BxuHHBP","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> /data1/workspace/weihongren/kda-runs/formal-kda-20260916--sol_execbench--L1-005_conv_gated_projection_with_causal_conv/candidates.jsonl <<'EOF'\n{\"candidate_id\": \"c002\", \"parent\": \"c001\", \"source_sha256\": \"e3125cb9dd66a438a90eac8a6e9f008c2defec7da35c9689fa2815d304eef8b2\", \"hypothesis\": \"Phase B (P1): c001's fixed 64x64x32 GEMM tile underperforms cuBLAS at large M (WL3 0.889x). Add @triton.autotune over a curated Ampere bf16 tile menu on the shared GEMM kernel (used by both K1 and K3), keyed on (M,N,K). All feedback shapes are mask-free (M mult 256, N mult 256, K mult 128). Expect the single largest geomean jump, especially recovering WL3 to >=1x.\", \"change_vs_parent\": \"Added @triton.autotune (11 configs: BLOCK_M/N in {64,128,256}, BLOCK_K in {32,64}, GROUP_M=8, stages 3-4, warps 4-8) on _gemm_bias_kernel keyed on (M,N,K); removed fixed per-call BLOCK/warps/stages; grid lambdas now read META['BLOCK_M/N']. K2 fused conv kernel and all numerics unchanged.\", \"validation\": {\"analytical_checks\": [\"kernel math identical to c001 (only tile-selection policy changed)\", \"all feedback shapes divide every tile evenly -> mask-free correctness preserved\", \"fp32 accum + bf16 store unchanged\", \"K2 unchanged\"], \"expected_correct\": true}, \"results\": {\"b0a9e3f0\": {\"axes\": {\"B\": 1, \"S\": 1024}, \"correct\": true, \"speedup\": 1.6626}, \"8b678b13\": {\"axes\": {\"B\": 4, \"S\": 256}, \"correct\": true, \"speedup\": 1.6746}, \"58e3ac47\": {\"axes\": {\"B\": 32, \"S\": 256}, \"correct\": true, \"speedup\": 1.3147}, \"6033fd0f\": {\"axes\": {\"B\": 2, \"S\": 4096}, \"correct\": true, \"speedup\": 1.3296}, \"bb262a64\": {\"axes\": {\"B\": 1, \"S\": 2048}, \"correct\": true, \"speedup\": 1.4000}}, \"geomean_speedup\": 1.4678, \"all_correct\": true, \"decision\": \"accept\", \"decision_reason\": \"All 5 correct; geomean 1.0809x -> 1.4678x (+35.8%), the single largest jump so far, confirming prediction P1 (GEMMs dominate, tile policy is the primary lever). WL3 recovered from 0.889x to 1.315x. New current best-correct. Next: Phase C (fuse/tile the memory-bound K2) since GEMM tuning is largely captured; small-M cases (WL1/2 at ~1.66x) now lead, large-M (WL3/4 ~1.32x) lag -> remaining headroom is intermediate-traffic + launch overhead reduction.\", \"cumulative_evals\": 2, \"skill_usage\": \"none (KernelWiki N/A for sm_80; profiler disallowed)\"}\nEOF\necho \"appended\"; wc -l /data1/workspace/weihongren/kda-runs/formal-kda-20260916--sol_execbench--L1-005_conv_gated_projection_with_causal_conv/candidates.jsonl","description":"Append c002 evidence record to candidates.jsonl"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":43358,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":4871,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b8e044ef-369c-4078-b4f1-f9181e49de1a","uuid":"ab673999-be65-4904-b2eb-9d8c419dd2fb","timestamp":"2026-09-16T17:30:08.298Z"}
